    <string name="how_to_play">How to Play</string>
    <string name="help_description">How to play</string>
    <string name="how_title">How to Play</string>
    <string name="how_goal_h">GOAL</string>
    <string name="how_goal">Slide the numbered tiles and merge matching ones to build bigger numbers. Create the 2048 tile to win.</string>
    <string name="how_move_h">HOW TO MOVE</string>
    <string name="how_move">Swipe left, right, up or down anywhere on the screen. Every tile slides as far as it can in that direction. After each move that changes the board, a new 2 or 4 tile appears.</string>
    <string name="how_merge_h">MERGING</string>
    <string name="how_merge">When two tiles with the same number touch, they merge into one tile with double the value, and the new value is added to your score. A tile can merge only once per move.</string>
    <string name="how_ladder_h">TILE LADDER</string>
    <string name="how_ladder">Keep merging to climb the ladder up to the glowing 2048 tile.</string>
    <string name="how_win_h">HOW YOU WIN</string>
    <string name="how_win_1">1. Merge two 1024 tiles to create a 2048 tile.</string>
    <string name="how_win_2">2. Confetti and a fanfare celebrate, then the Victory screen shows your score.</string>
    <string name="how_win_3">3. Keep Going lets you play on for an even bigger tile. The win is counted once, and the Victory screen will not appear again in the same game.</string>
    <string name="how_win_4">4. New Game ends the run. Your score goes to the Hall of Fame with a WIN badge and your Stats record the win.</string>
    <string name="how_over_h">GAME OVER</string>
    <string name="how_over">The game ends when the board is full and no neighbouring tiles match. Your score is saved to the Hall of Fame.</string>
    <string name="how_help_h">UNDO AND HINT</string>
    <string name="how_help">Watch a short rewarded ad to undo your last move, or to see the best next move shown with a glowing arrow.</string>
    <string name="how_tips_h">PRO TIPS</string>
    <string name="how_tips">Keep your biggest tile in a corner. Build a descending chain of tiles along one edge. Avoid swiping away from your corner unless you have to.</string>
    <string name="how_got_it">Got it!</string>
    <string name="win_badge">WIN</string>
